# File: synth_v1.ys
# Author: Diego Dominguez
# Hierarchy: synthesis flow for top-level module alu_v1.
# Function: checks hierarchy, performs generic synthesis, and writes BLIF.
# Parameters: none. Clock domains: none; the synthesized RTL is combinational.
# Timing: the reported b[1] to result[31] path is documented in README.md.
read_verilog alu_v1.v
hierarchy -check -top alu_v1
synth -top alu_v1

write_blif alu_v1.blif